{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a000000000000002","type":"group","x":-320,"y":440,"width":4120,"height":1560,"color":"2","label":"Execution Order / JSON 配置到页面回流主流程"},
		{"id":"a000000000000007","type":"group","x":-320,"y":2460,"width":5320,"height":620,"color":"2","label":"Flow Explanation / 流程解释"},
		{"id":"a000000000000006","type":"group","x":-320,"y":2120,"width":1500,"height":220,"color":"1","label":"Questions / Needs Confirmation"},
		{"id":"a000000000000003","type":"group","x":-1280,"y":-1760,"width":3080,"height":840,"color":"5","label":"Component Communication / 组件通信"},
		{"id":"a000000000000004","type":"group","x":740,"y":-760,"width":2000,"height":660,"color":"6","label":"State / Store / API / Storage"},
		{"id":"a000000000000001","type":"group","x":-360,"y":-760,"width":1070,"height":990,"color":"4","label":"Project Reading Entry / 阅读入口"},
		{"id":"a000000000000005","type":"group","x":-1280,"y":-760,"width":560,"height":1320,"color":"1","label":"Key / Difficult Points"},
		{"id":"b000000000000001","type":"file","file":"ProjectInCompany/travelKnowledge/我的整理/Vue Components Communication 整理/DSL/JSON.md","x":-320,"y":-700,"width":300,"height":480,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## 一句话结论\n\napproval 模块不是单纯 props 传值，而是：\n\n配置驱动渲染 + 页面容器编排 + 弹窗局部表单 + 详情二次拉取。\n\n读图时先看主流程，再看通信方式。","x":260,"y":-700,"width":340,"height":480,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## 推荐阅读顺序\n\n1. 主流程：接口事实如何经过 JSON 配置变成页面\n2. web：父容器如何编排弹窗和详情\n3. uniapp：路由页如何用 query + 事件回流\n4. 难点：配置不是状态、撤回重提、详情二次拉取","x":-320,"y":-160,"width":920,"height":265,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## 配置不是状态\n\n不是 source of truth：\n- approvalBizTypeConfig\n- detailApiMap\n- bizTypeTitleMap\n- bizTypeIconMap\n- statusUiMap/searchStatusMap\n- buildApprovalDetailFields 返回值\n- buildApprovalFlows 返回值\n\n它们只回答：怎么展示、怎么映射、怎么派生。","x":800,"y":-700,"width":360,"height":435,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## 真实页面状态\n\nsource of truth 更接近：\n- approvalList\n- pendingList/doneList/myList\n- currentApprovalDetail\n- fetchedDetail\n- form/receiveForm/returnForm\n- 审批意见和上传状态\n\n状态归属原则：\n页面级状态归容器，短生命周期输入归弹窗/详情页。","x":1500,"y":-700,"width":360,"height":435,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## Store / API / Storage\n\nStore:\n- useAccountStore 只放登录人、账号类型、COS 配置、临时工身份\n- 审批列表不放 store\n\nAPI:\n- @travel/api 负责列表、详情、审批、撤回、文件上传登记\n- detailApiMap 按 bizType 分发详情接口\n\nStorage:\n- 当前分析范围未看到 approval 专属本地缓存读写。","x":2140,"y":-700,"width":420,"height":435,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"f000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 配置对象容易被误认为状态\n\nWhy hard:\n- 映射表、字段构造函数、流程构造函数看起来都像数据。\n\nHow to read:\n- 配置只描述展示规则。\n- 业务事实仍从接口、store、表单输入来。","x":-1240,"y":-680,"width":480,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 撤回重提跨多个节点\n\nEvidence:\n- ApprovalDetail.vue emit withdrawn(payload)\n- index.vue 接收后刷新列表\n- withdrawnResubmitDialogMap 决定重开哪个编辑弹窗\n\nRisk:\n- 改 bizType 或弹窗名时容易漏配置。","x":-1240,"y":-480,"width":480,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 详情二次拉取\n\nWhy hard:\n- 父级只给基础 payload。\n- 详情弹窗/详情页再 fetchDetail 拉完整详情。\n\nBenefit:\n- 列表卡片轻量，详情状态更新鲜。\n\nRisk:\n- 不要误以为列表 item 已包含完整详情。","x":-1240,"y":-240,"width":480,"height":175,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 末级审批扩展 JSON\n\nWhy hard:\n- 岗位反馈不是普通 remark。\n- extra.processResult 和 extra.evidenceUrls 会随 auditFormBase 回传。\n- flow.js 后续解析节点扩展 JSON 再用于展示。\n\nRead it with the approval flow, not as isolated upload logic.","x":-1240,"y":-10,"width":480,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: Storage 为空也很重要\n\n当前没有看到本地缓存参与 approval 刷新链路。跨页面刷新优先靠重新请求，别默认加 storage。","x":-1240,"y":280,"width":480,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## Parent: approval/index.vue\n\nLayer:\n- Page / Container\n\nOwns:\n- 列表和分页\n- 当前详情基础 payload\n- 弹窗显隐控制权\n- 撤回后的编辑数据\n\nDoes:\n- 打开弹窗\n- 拉列表\n- 处理子组件事件\n- 决定结果如何回流","x":-1160,"y":-1700,"width":310,"height":588,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## Down: props / v-model\n\n通信类型：\n- value\n- control authority\n\n传下去：\n- v-model:visible\n- mode\n- editData\n- row\n- data=currentApprovalDetail\n\n含义：\n父级给最小上下文，子级只处理自己的局部任务。","x":-540,"y":-1700,"width":370,"height":588,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## Child: 表单/详情弹窗\n\nLayer:\n- Business Block\n\nOwns:\n- form/receiveForm/returnForm\n- fetchedDetail\n- 审批意见\n- 凭证上传状态\n\nDoes:\n- 校验和提交\n- 拉完整详情\n- 审批或撤回\n- 只把业务事件抛回父级","x":130,"y":-1700,"width":340,"height":588,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## Up: emit / event\n\n通信类型：\n- action\n\n发上来：\n- select(type)\n- submitted\n- success\n- audited\n- withdrawn(payload)\n\n含义：\n子组件不直接改父级列表，只表达业务动作完成。","x":815,"y":-1700,"width":310,"height":588,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## Flow Back: 父级更新\n\n回流方式：\n- 刷新 approvalList\n- 更新 currentApprovalDetail\n- 写入 docDialogEditData\n- 根据 bizType 打开对应弹窗\n- 新 props / v-model 再流向子级\n\n这保持了封装性：业务编排留在父容器。","x":1460,"y":-1700,"width":310,"height":588,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c000000000000006","type":"text","text":"## Step 6A: web 回流\n\n提交成功：\n- 子弹窗 emit submitted/success\n- 父容器 fetchApprovalList\n\n审批成功：\n- ApprovalDetail emit audited\n- 父容器刷新列表\n\n撤回重提：\n- emit withdrawn(payload)\n- 父容器刷新列表\n- 根据 bizType 重开编辑弹窗","x":3120,"y":520,"width":260,"height":640,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c000000000000007","type":"text","text":"## Step 4B: uniapp 列表页\n\n文件：\n- packageApproval/approval/index.vue\n\nLayer:\n- Page / Container\n\nOwns state:\n- activeTab\n- pendingList/doneList/myList\n- pagination/loading\n\nTriggers:\n- 首次进入\n- 切 tab\n- 触底加载\n- 下拉刷新\n- refreshApprovalList 事件","x":1780,"y":1320,"width":300,"height":600,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c000000000000008","type":"text","text":"## Step 5B: uniapp 详情/审核页\n\n文件：\n- detail/detail.vue\n- audit/index.vue\n- approval/detail.vue\n\nLayer:\n- Page / Container\n\nReceives:\n- route query: id/type/status\n\nOwns state:\n- fetchedDetail\n- 审批意见\n- 最终处理结果\n- 上传文件/提交 loading","x":2410,"y":1320,"width":300,"height":600,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## 总流程\n\n后端业务数据\n-> 公共 JSON/对象工具层\n-> bizType 配置映射\n-> 页面容器持有状态并编排\n-> 弹窗/详情页处理局部动作\n-> emit / uni.$emit 通知回流\n-> 父级或列表页重新拉接口并渲染","x":-280,"y":2520,"width":500,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"h000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## web 端流程\n\n1. `approval/index.vue` 持有真实页面状态：列表、筛选、分页、弹窗 visible、当前详情、撤回重提 editData。\n\n2. 初始化、筛选、分页、提交成功、审批成功、撤回成功都会触发 `fetchApprovalList()`。\n\n3. 接口返回后，经 `approvalBizTypeConfig`、`statusUiMap`、`buildApprovalCard()` 等配置转换成卡片展示结构。","x":570,"y":2520,"width":560,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## web 子组件回流\n\n新建单据：\n- `SelectApproval.vue` 点击类型\n- `emit('select', type)`\n- 父级打开对应表单弹窗\n\n表单提交：\n- `Daily/Purchase/Receive` 等只持有局部 form\n- 成功后 `emit('submitted')` 或 `emit('success')`\n- 父级收到后刷新列表\n\n通信本质：\n父级给值和控制权，子级只发动作。","x":1510,"y":2520,"width":560,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## 撤回重提交流程\n\n`ApprovalDetail.vue` 点击撤回\n-> 调 `withdrawFormBase`\n-> 成功后 `emit('withdrawn', payload)`\n-> `approval/index.vue` 接收 payload\n-> 先刷新列表\n-> 用 `withdrawnResubmitDialogMap` 找到编辑弹窗\n-> 把 detail 写入 editData\n-> 重新打开对应表单弹窗\n\n关键：详情弹窗不编排页面，父容器才负责重开弹窗。","x":2560,"y":2520,"width":560,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"g000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## Needs Confirmation\n\n这张图基于当前笔记 `JSON.md` 的分析结论绘制，没有重新打开 travel-web 源码逐个调用点复核。因此代码行级证据、函数实参细节、具体接口路径如需确认，下一步应回到对应源码目录逐文件核验。","x":-280,"y":2180,"width":1420,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## Step 3: bizType 映射配置\n\n位置：\n- web shared/*.js\n- uniapp approval/detailConfig.js\n\n映射内容：\n- bizType -> API\n- bizType -> 标题/图标\n- bizType -> 卡片字段\n- bizType -> 撤回后打开哪个弹窗\n\n注意：这些是配置，不是业务状态。","x":970,"y":520,"width":300,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## Step 1: 后端业务事实\n\n来源：\n- 列表接口\n- 详情接口\n- 审批/撤回接口\n- workflowConfig\n- 节点扩展 JSON\n\n含义：\n真正的业务事实来自接口，不来自前端配置对象。","x":-280,"y":520,"width":300,"height":560,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## Step 2: 公共工具层\n\n文件：\n- packages/tool/src/approval/flow.js\n- packages/tool/src/approval/detailFields.js\n\n做什么：\n- buildApprovalFlows 生成流程时间线\n- buildApprovalDetailFields 生成详情字段\n\n影响：\n把后端 JSON 变成前端更好渲染的结构。","x":360,"y":520,"width":300,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## Step 4A: web 页面容器\n\n文件：\n- sites/web/src/pages/approval/index.vue\n\nLayer:\n- Page / Container\n\nOwns state:\n- approvalList\n- pagination/search\n- currentApprovalDetail\n- 各类弹窗 visible\n- 撤回重提 editData\n\nTriggers:\n- onMounted\n- watch/search/page change\n- child emit","x":1780,"y":520,"width":300,"height":640,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## Step 5A: web 子弹窗/详情\n\n组件：\n- SelectApproval.vue\n- Daily/Purchase/CardRepair\n- Receive/return\n- ApprovalDetail.vue\n\nLayer:\n- Business Block\n\nOwns state:\n- 局部表单\n- fetchedDetail\n- 审批意见/撤回 loading\n\nSends up:\n- select\n- submitted/success\n- audited/withdrawn","x":2410,"y":520,"width":300,"height":640,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c000000000000009","type":"text","text":"## Step 6B: uniapp 回流\n\n审批/撤回成功后：\n- uni.$emit(refreshApprovalList)\n- uni.navigateBack()\n\n列表页监听：\n- uni.$on(refreshApprovalList, fetchApprovalList)\n\n本质：\n跨路由页面通知重新拉数据，不是把列表放进共享状态。","x":3120,"y":1320,"width":260,"height":600,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"h000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## uniapp 端流程\n\n`approval/index.vue` 列表页\n-> 点击卡片\n-> `navigateTo` 只传 `id/type`\n-> detail 或 audit 页面重新拉详情\n-> 审批/撤回成功\n-> `uni.$emit('refreshApprovalList')`\n-> `uni.navigateBack()`\n-> 列表页监听事件后重新 `fetchApprovalList`\n\n本质：路由页通信，不是 props/emit 父子通信。","x":3640,"y":2520,"width":560,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h000000000000006","type":"text","text":"## 一句话记忆\n\n配置对象负责“怎么展示”。\n\n页面容器负责“状态和编排”。\n\n子弹窗负责“局部填写/提交”。\n\n详情页负责“拉完整详情/审批/撤回”。\n\n回流统一靠事件通知父级或列表页重新拉数据。","x":4560,"y":2520,"width":360,"height":420,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
